## 4. ID Prefix Registry

### 4.1 Patient Record Prefixes (CLN.PT)

| Prefix | Usage | Example |
|--------|-------|---------|
| PT- | Patient profile / baseline | [PT-PROFILE], [PT-BASELINE-MOBILITY] |
| PROB- | Problem | [PROB-CHF], [PROB-DELIRIUM] |
| DX- | Diagnosis | [DX-PRIMARY], [DX-COMORBID-1] |
| RISK- | Clinical risk | [RISK-FALLS], [RISK-READMISSION] |
| MED- | Medication | [MED-ANTICOAGULANT], [MED-HELD-1] |
| ORD- | Order / restriction | [ORD-NPO], [ORD-FALL-PRECAUTIONS] |
| FUNC- | Functional status | [FUNC-AMBULATION], [FUNC-ADL] |
| GOAL- | Care goal | [GOAL-RETURN-HOME], [GOAL-PAIN-CONTROL] |
| GATE- | Discharge / transition gate | [GATE-SAFE-DISCHARGE], [GATE-PT-CLEARANCE] |

### 4.2 Care Team Prefixes (CLN.CARE)

| Prefix | Usage | Example |
|--------|-------|---------|
| CLIN- | Clinician / provider | [CLIN-ATTENDING], [CLIN-PT] |
| FAM- | Family member / advocate | [FAM-ADVOCATE], [FAM-POA] |
| FACIL- | Facility / care setting | [FACIL-HOSPITAL], [FACIL-SNF] |
| POS- | Institutional position | [POS-FACIL-DISCHARGE-READY] |

### 4.3 Evidence Prefixes (CLN.EVID)

| Prefix | Usage | Example |
|--------|-------|---------|
| OBS- | Clinical observation | [OBS-GAIT-2026-02-25], [OBS-VITALS] |
| COMM- | Communication log entry | [COMM-CARE-CONFERENCE-1] |
| DOC- | Document / administrative record | [DOC-DISCHARGE-PLAN], [DOC-APPEAL] |
| CONFLICT- | Conflict record | [CONFLICT-DISCHARGE-DISPUTE] |

